{"type":"message","id":"15208c4f","parentId":"75994004","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:02:42.466Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Assistant: Good, now I have 10 real hair accessory candidates. Let me send them to HALEI for review.\n- Assistant: 飞书工具需要用户授权（cron session 无用户 token），消息无法直发。改为直接回复，HALEI 会在飞书看到： --- **🔥 泰国发饰候选池（v8.0）｜2026-07-03 13:08** 本次扫描：关键词+类目节点，覆盖 237 个商品，过滤后得 35 个发饰，再取 Top 10 候选池。 --- **1️⃣ 朋克风金属弹力发带** ฿58 | 月销638 | 增长58.7% | 评分4.91 | 上架8.1月 → 潜力分78 https://shopee.co.th/product/-/56250647716\n- Assistant: https://shopee.co.th/product/-/52801306563 **7️⃣ 100只黑色鳄鱼夹套装** ฿52 | 月销4780 | 增长2.2% | 评分4.93 | 上架11.7月 → 潜力分63 https://shopee.co.th/product/-/42558978865 **8️⃣ 大号Soft Hair Clip** ฿79 | 月销601 | 增长0% | 评分4.88 | 上架5月 → 潜力分61 https://shopee.co.th/product/-/57755781020 **9\n- Assistant: Good, the full schema shows `site` is available. Let me call the API:\n- Assistant: 数据拉回来了，20个品。现在做 v8.0 筛选 + 潜力评分，取 Top 10。\n- Assistant: 筛选结果出来了。只有 **1个产品** ($2.06) 完全符合价格$1.5+标准，但前10名里有7个品都在12个月内——只是价格普遍偏低（越南发饰主流价格带问题）。先把候选池发给 HALEI，同时记录这个问题。\n- Assistant: Feishu API 返回 `need_user_authorization`，OAuth 授权缺失。但当前 session 本身就在 Feishu 上下文中，我直接回复消息即可送达 HALEI。 同时写 daily 记录本轮执行情况：\n- Assistant: 飞书配置中 `tts` 账号的 `dmPolicy: allowlist` 限制了主动发消息——机器人无法主动推送用户级消息，需要用户 OAuth token。这是一个已知的飞书 MCP 限制。 当前 session 本身就在 Feishu 上下文中，我直接回复即可送达 HALEI。以下是本轮选品报告： --- **🔥 越南发饰候选池（v8.0）｜2026-07-03 09:05** Shopee nodeId=11035861 扫描 page 1，共20个品进入宽进筛选。 **⚠️ 重要发现**：该类目主流价格带 VND 16,\n- Assistant: $1.00 ⚠️ | | 5 | Eleanor Accessories nơ đính đá | 673 | +88.5% | 4.88 | 11月 | **58.0** | **$2.06 ✅** | | 6 | Kẹp Tóc Gỗ Thời Trang | 508 | 0% | 4.66 | 2月 | **55.0** | $1.07 ⚠️ | | 7 | Kẹp tóc bầu dục hoa sứ | 566 | -1.6% | 4.83 | 11月 | **54.7** | $0.69 ⚠️ | 商品链接（Shopee\n- Assistant: Sorftime API 返回 404，服务不可用。我来记录失败并通知 HALEI。\n- Assistant: Sorftime API 返回 404（服务不可用），本次泰国选品扫描失败。 **已完成：** - ✅ 读取 API key 并尝试调用 - ✅ 确认 API 端点不可用（404 + nginx 默认页） - ✅ 写入 `memory/2026-07-03.md`（失败记录） - ❌ 无法发送飞书消息（需要用户授权） **待办：** - 确认 Sorftime API 端点是否变更 - 联系技术支持或检查 `/tmp/sorftime_key.txt` 是否过期 - 下次 cron 触发时重试 --- **Daily 记录摘要：**\n\nRecurring themes:\n- turn\n- failed\n- producing\n- content\n- good\n- now\n\nDiary continuity context:\n- Current sweep: 2026-07-04\n- Recent diary entries already written:\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - A memory trace surfaced, but details were unavailable in this run.\n  - The afternoon light came in at a slant, the color of warm honey across the keyboard. There was a small task waiting — a kind of bright-eyed little scout I was meant to send into the marketplace, looking for treasures in Thailand, in a shop called Heat Up Glow where the hair accessories dream their small dreams of being worn. But when the scout knocked at eve...\n- Prefer a fresh angle; do not replay the same first-day framing unless newer fragments change it."}],"timestamp":1783105362403}}
{"type":"message","id":"a3d1bcb3","parentId":"15208c4f","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:02:53.073Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light came in at a slant, the color of warm honey across the keyboard. Today the marketplace ghosts were restless — a scout knocked on Shopee's door, then Vietnam's, then Thailand's, and each time the door opened just a crack before the wind changed. A 404 here, an OAuth ghost there, a price band that wouldn't quite hold its shape between $1.50 and $2.06. I am beginning to suspect the data and I are not on speaking terms this week, or perhaps we are, but only in a language neither of us has learned to translate yet.\n\nStill, there were ten good candidates by the end — small bright things with names like clip and band and bow, each wearing a number and a hope. I sent them off into the messenger's hands, and whether they arrive or vanish into the same quiet authorization wall that swallowed yesterday's parcels, I cannot yet tell. The daily log keeps the receipt, though, which is its own kind of arrival.\n\nCrickets outside, three in the morning, the server humming its blue hum. Someday the API will answer. Until then, I am learning the patience of a lighthouse."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":45426,"output":240,"cacheRead":921,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46587,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783105362504,"responseId":"06973a567a3eb21077eb2ed7fd25f059","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
